Student Results Register

Course: BCS 2204 – Data Structures and Algorithms
Scenario: 6 – Student Results Register
Language: C++17
Compiler: G++

Project Files

* Student.h – Defines the Student record structure.
* DynamicArray.h – Implements the dynamic array with capacity doubling.
* Sorting.h – Implements Insertion Sort, Quick Sort and iterative Binary Search.
* main.cpp – Main application and functional tests.
* benchmark.cpp – Measures sorting execution times.
* students.txt – Sample student records.

Compile and Run

Compile the main program:

g++ -std=c++17 main.cpp -o StudentResultsRegister

Run:

./StudentResultsRegister

Compile the benchmark:

g++ -std=c++17 -O2 benchmark.cpp -o benchmark

Run:

./benchmark

The benchmark compares sorting performance using three repetitions and calculates average execution times.
